\f0\fs24 \cf0 The Academic English App is an online app designed to improve reading and comprehension for secondary school students. The app is not designed as a teaching tool, but a resource to improve literacy across the curriculum.\
The theory is simple: language is the most used tool in academic settings; all subjects rely on it heavily. However, modern living is restricting students\'92 access to language. Without regular access to language our ability to comprehend ideas is being hugely reduced. This is compounded for students who are learning English as second language. \
The app has a range of \'93games\'94 that are designed to expose students to language in a way that forces them to engage with the sentences and read consciously.  \
\
\
The exercise analogy:\
If learning was exercise, and schools were a gym: \
The Academic English App is NOT weight training, it\'92s cardio.\
It\'92s not going to build skills or inspire students, it\'92s going to expose them to language in a way that will help them learn the words and concepts.\
